sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-sekimura-papilio-wing-stripe-mimicry> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sekimura-papilio-wing-stripe-mimicry-code-traceability> .
